{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:66fec0f76dc7413574aeed9e8f48245ec24ccf0d1c9c8f592f2e9d4ab4c73319",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f977ff952232ae027c4254d6307a5c8a9917a68b180bc882486f54c82735dc3a",
      "text": "打扰了！\n我是315 Production的握野英雄……哇啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:422a21cde551d01007396c56b4d2bfaca118f14703dd78c7700c12d667050983",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d28caf1297d8fdfa4d4711f3dc26c9674b5ea52ccc510596821af14721e8a2e9",
      "text": "什……哎！？\n你们两个，怎么会在这里！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:487ca47924aec9614d4801abc39abbed916607e2fab3029cfc3075a3fc283ae3",
      "text": "啊哈哈，其实今天英雄先生的工作\n不是美食探店，而是生日会直播哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0020080a5336bd6239296fca7400593058aa47fd426a6b36b488ffa228de4817",
      "text": "吓了一跳吧。你看，屏幕对面的\n粉丝们也送来了这么多的祝福哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1255d1093f7ebdf102c1da86530256be43bd0cf987644acf7581d236b174d18b",
      "text": "等、等一下。\n这个现在正在直播中吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65e81eb9b97a682effe1f2a038fad33285a1e70cbe6f1c374b975574b6543a24",
      "text": "刚才不是说了是直播吗。\n来，主角快到镜头前去。大家都在等着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbdb192d746db62c5d195551512ef71d20767fa94a5b1919cfae0e8c203b35c5",
      "text": "噢、噢……\n我现在脸上的表情僵硬吗？没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f51f7eaf1f4729b45e1794c7ba212bc01239d6150b08176fed0e9a3624b9dc8",
      "text": "没问题，现在也是英雄先生一贯凛然帅气的表情！\n啊，弹幕也说没问题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d18e94d084d938b17069b9b5821e1737ff804275b2c7b19e1a9d75a53fd50f9b",
      "text": "真是的，大家全都跟着瞎起哄……\n不过这工作真让人高兴啊，谢谢你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
